<section class="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow">Cluster — Same-day response</span>
<h1>Furniture inspection &amp; supplier verification in Jaipur</h1>
<p class="lead">Carved, painted, bone-inlay and heritage-style furniture—the craft belt shared with Jodhpur. Full cluster guide publishing soon—every Qualis service is available here now, with same-day response.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/why-independent/">Why independent</a></div>
</div>
</section>
<section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Subcontracted carving</h3><p>Carving and inlay routinely happen in home workshops outside the factory — quality varies by hand unless someone maps and checks the flow.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Paint &amp; lacquer consistency</h3><p>Hand-painted lines drift between batches; a frozen golden sample is the only defensible standard.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/defects/"><h3>Inlay adhesion</h3><p>Bone and acrylic inlay lifting in dry destination climates — caught with adhesion and finish checks at PSI.</p></a></div></div></section><section><div class="wrap prose-wrap"><p class="prose rv">Jaipur's workshops produce the decorated end of the Indian range: hand-carved, hand-painted, bone-inlay and distressed heritage pieces. The craft is the value and the risk—hand processes across dispersed workshops need golden-sample discipline and mid-production checks more than any other cluster. Same-day response from our Jodhpur base.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div class="grid"><a class="card rv" href="/pre-shipment-inspection-india/"><h3>Pre-Shipment Inspection</h3><p>AQL 2.5, moisture, structure, finish vs golden sample — report in 24h.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/supplier-verification-india/"><h3>Supplier Verification</h3><p>Unannounced premises visits, verdict in 3–5 working days.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/factory-audit-india/"><h3>Factory Audit</h3><p>8-section scored audit for programme onboarding.</p></a><a class="card rv" href="/container-loading-supervision/"><h3>Container Loading Supervision</h3><p>Tally, dunnage, weather hold and photographed seal.</p></a></div></div></section>
<section class="final">
<div class="wrap">

<h2>Your next India order. Protected.</h2>
<p>Confirmed within 2 hours. Report within 24 hours of inspection. Paid by buyers only — never by factories.</p>
<a class="btn btn-solid" href="/#book">Book an inspection</a>
</div>
</section>
